{"id":"99a8573dd28105ee","group":"28","path":"28/28-cor-log-seed-derandomization.md","title":"指数伸长与BPP确定化","display":"cor-log-seed-derandomization — 指数伸长与BPP确定化","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-cor-log-seed-derandomization","aliases":["28-cor-log-seed-derandomization"],"display":"cor-log-seed-derandomization — 指数伸长与BPP确定化","depends_on":["[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]","[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]","[[28-df-bpp]]","[[28-df-p]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Corollary 20.4(1) and proof of Lemma 20.3","source_printed_pages":"404–405","source_pdf_pages":"430–431","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":true,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-cor-log-seed-derandomization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-cor-log-seed-derandomization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-log-seed-derandomization — 指数伸长与BPP确定化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc596ec4c1021296\" href=\"?note=fc596ec4c1021296\" title=\"28-df-derandomization-prg\">28-df-derandomization-prg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31f962b1eba87e25\" href=\"?note=31f962b1eba87e25\" title=\"28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration\">28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Corollary 20.4(1) and proof of Lemma 20.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"404–405"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"430–431"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DPRG}\">\\(\\operatorname{DPRG}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc596ec4c1021296\" href=\"?note=fc596ec4c1021296\" title=\"28-df-derandomization-prg\">28-df-derandomization-prg</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPP}\">\\(\\mathbf{BPP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> 为实数参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1,\\lfloor2^{\\delta\\ell}\\rfloor\\}\\qquad(\\delta&gt;0,\\;\\ell\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1,\\lfloor2^{\\delta\\ell}\\rfloor\\}\\qquad(\\delta&gt;0,\\;\\ell\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left[\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\exists G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta)\\right]\\Longrightarrow\\mathbf{BPP}=\\mathbf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left[\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\exists G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta)\\right]\\Longrightarrow\\mathbf{BPP}=\\mathbf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>局部证明：取任意 BPP 机器及其多项式时间、随机位界。固定输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 后，将随机串到输出的确定性计算展开为电路，使用经典计算表逐步模拟，得到大小为原运行时间的某个固定次多项式的有界扇入电路。取足够大的多项式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(n)\">\\(q(n)\\)</span> 同时控制随机位数和该电路的总节点数。\n选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)=\\lceil k\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\">\\(\\ell(n)=\\lceil k\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\)</span>，其中固定整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 足够大，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta(\\ell(n))\\ge q(n)\">\\(m=\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta(\\ell(n))\\ge q(n)\\)</span>。补足未使用随机位后，该机器的测试电路属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(m^3)\">\\(\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(m^3)\\)</span>（输入节点贡献 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，其余门为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(n)\">\\(q(n)\\)</span> 量级，有限小长度另硬接线处理）。生成器的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/10\">\\(1/10\\)</span> 欺骗性使每输入的成功率大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2/3-1/10&gt;1/2\">\\(2/3-1/10&gt;1/2\\)</span>。\n枚举全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\ell(n)}\">\\(2^{\\ell(n)}\\)</span> 个种子并取多数，按种子枚举命题输出正确。每种子生成耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{O(\\ell(n))}\">\\(2^{O(\\ell(n))}\\)</span>，原机器模拟为多项式时间，故总时间为多项式。P 包含于 BPP 由忽略随机带立即得到。\n这是从指数伸长假设出发的独立模拟证明；没有把仅核对陈述的困难性到 PRG 深定理用作证明前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-derandomization-prg","status":"resolved","id":"fc596ec4c1021296","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"31f962b1eba87e25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-derandomization-prg","status":"resolved","id":"fc596ec4c1021296","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{DPRG}$ 见 [[28-df-derandomization-prg]]；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 与 $\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-p]]。$\\delta$ 为实数参数，$\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{DPRG}$ 见 [[28-df-derandomization-prg]]；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 与 $\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-p]]。$\\delta$ 为实数参数，$\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\operatorname{DPRG}$ 见 [[28-df-derandomization-prg]]；$\\mathbf{BPP}$ 与 $\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-p]]。$\\delta$ 为实数参数，$\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta$ 由下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DPRG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{BPP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\max\\{1,\\lfloor2^{\\delta\\ell}\\rfloor\\}\\qquad(\\delta>0,\\;\\ell\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left[\\exists\\delta>0\\;\\exists G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\;\\operatorname{DPRG}(G,\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta)\\right]\\Longrightarrow\\mathbf{BPP}=\\mathbf P.","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"q(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(n)=\\lceil k\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"m=\\operatorname{ExpStretch}_\\delta(\\ell(n))\\ge q(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CircuitTests}_m(m^3)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"q(n)","display":false},{"tex":"1/10","display":false},{"tex":"2/3-1/10>1/2","display":false},{"tex":"2^{\\ell(n)}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{O(\\ell(n))}","display":false}],"bytes":2532,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-252","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第20章：去随机化与NW构造：[[28-df-circuit-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-df-derandomization-prg]]、[[28-prop-prg-seed-enumeration]]、[[28-cor-log-seed-derandomization]]、[[28-df-nw-design]]、[[28-df-nw-generator]]、[[28-lem-circuit-hybrid-next-bit]]、[[28-lem-nw-design-existence]]、[[28-lem-nw-pseudorandomness]]、[[28-thm-hardness-derandomization]]。"}],"outgoing":["fc596ec4c1021296","31f962b1eba87e25","073a1a66749fa84e","dd9febae42d44280"]}